<title>GERMANY: FUEW sets 7.5 mln dmk rights issue.</title>
<headline>FUEW sets 7.5 mln dmk rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German utility Fraenkische Ueberlandwerk issued the following details of a rights issue on Monday.</p>
<p>Nominal share value 50 marks unless otherwise stated</p>
<p>Terms : 38 new shares for three already held.</p>
<p>Number of new shares : 150,000</p>
<p>Price of new shares : 280 marks</p>
<p>New shares entitled to dividend from July 1 1997</p>
<p>Nominal capital increased by 7.5 million marks to 102.5 million marks.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Fraenkische Ueberlandwerk AG.</p>
</text>
